</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 7.4)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:38.28em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="42.82" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.82)" width="529.69"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S5.SS2.p8.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:38.28em;">
<span id="S5.SS2.p8.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS2.p8.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">GMixout strikes an effective balance between accuracy and efficiency, maintaining competitive performance across diverse datasets while lowering compute and memory costs.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
